{"id":"176b8a6933703c34deba62f721f2f41c14df46a1","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1239007","title":"Mac 上知名截图软件 CleanShot X 付费升级有效期才一年？！","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"omz","excerpt":"macOS - @omz - 有点像订阅制，每年收我 130 元，老外的软件好用但真是贵。尝试几个国内开发的截图软件，体验都不咋地。我的是支持 2 台 Mac ，如果有老哥想和我一起分担下，可以留个联系方式，价格 65","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div><p>有点像订阅制，每年收我 130 元，老外的软件好用但真是贵。<br>尝试几个国内开发的截图软件，体验都不咋地。</p><p>我的是支持 2 台 Mac ，如果有老哥想和我一起分担下，可以留个联系方式，价格 65 （以后是否升级再商量）<br><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/234nj9a.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/234nj9a.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p></div><div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/截图\"><li></li> 截图</a><a href=\"/tag/Mac\"><li></li> Mac</a><a href=\"/tag/分享\"><li></li> 分享</a></P><p><span>18 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-09-03 12:50:02 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18043903\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0b26/8b1f/453614_normal.png?m=1763082552\" alt=\"Avedge\" data-uid=\"453614\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Avedge\">Avedge</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-02 18:19:08 +08:00\">1 day ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>改用 Shottr 了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18043909\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6372d80b2498cdf72a14099a5728ea05?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"coolcoffee\" data-uid=\"112903\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/coolcoffee\">coolcoffee</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-02 18:20:18 +08:00\">1 day ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>CleanShot X 的体验我感觉是一流的，我也买过 shottr 只能说平替但是总感觉差一点。 </p><p>另外 CleanShot X 不升级也基本能用，我经历过一个因为系统更新会导致旧版打不开的情况，开发商临时给升级了一个小版本，并且之前的授权允许更新到对应小版本。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18043912\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/cf088dd4af96fb317a7c820cd3064a62?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"omz\" data-uid=\"664401\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/omz\">omz</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-02 18:21:04 +08:00\">1 day ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/Avedge\">Avedge</a> 试用过，还是 CleanShot X 顺手，再加上它现在支持编辑视频更牛逼了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18043923\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9c57/392a/150867_normal.png?m=1786588077\" alt=\"qzhai\" data-uid=\"150867\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/qzhai\">qzhai</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-02 18:24:56 +08:00\">1 day ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>不太理解这种软件为什么要付费。。。  我基础组件都是 codex 自己开发的。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18043928\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6c2b/646b/621283_normal.png?m=1692511549\" alt=\"gpt5\" data-uid=\"621283\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/gpt5\">gpt5</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-02 18:27:26 +08:00\">1 day ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>一直用 ishort pro ，但它的录屏不好，现在来还没适配系统录屏 api ，于是试用了 cleanshot x ，录屏很好，但是一些截图的细节用不习惯，只好继续将就着用 ishort 了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18043941\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/df96/40a1/449325_normal.png?m=1770281404\" alt=\"Goalonez\" data-uid=\"449325\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Goalonez\">Goalonez</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-02 18:33:02 +08:00\">1 day ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>目前用 longshot ，之前续了几年，感觉这种类型的软件不值得订阅制，还是买个永久版的，差距也没那么大</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18043983\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/743cc98c80fe156caafa599da1820fd2?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"wdd2007\" data-uid=\"12342\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/wdd2007\">wdd2007</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-02 18:47:31 +08:00\">1 day ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>最近看到的一个，免费的 capcap ，也还可以。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18043988\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/671d/e109/184848_normal.png?m=1754061589\" alt=\"sankemao\" data-uid=\"184848\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/sankemao\">sankemao</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-02 18:48:56 +08:00\">1 day ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>用不惯国外这些开发者的截图逻辑，还是更喜欢 qq 截图逻辑</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18044049\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/52776796925cc7c5369724a2f82d914c?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"mangoDB\" data-uid=\"338641\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/mangoDB\">mangoDB</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-02 19:20:49 +08:00\">1 day ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>订阅制获取持续更新的能力，如果不续订应该是可以继续使用当前版本的。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18044610\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/0ab294bddd04083af2ebfa87680fd623?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Lenic\" data-uid=\"96585\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Lenic\">Lenic</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 08:11:19 +08:00\">12h 2m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>OP 可以看下 SetApp ，能用的软件大概有很多，每年的价格也只是翻了一倍，注意真要用的话要找家庭版</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18044675\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b0c6/6f54/415795_normal.png?m=1782213343\" alt=\"Leeeeex\" data-uid=\"415795\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Leeeeex\">Leeeeex</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 08:45:32 +08:00\">11h 27m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>pixpin 也挺好用的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18044694\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/8cb9/28e6/124590_normal.png?m=1539075573\" alt=\"maemolee\" data-uid=\"124590\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/maemolee\">maemolee</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 08:51:15 +08:00\">11h 22m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我一直用 Xnip ，没觉得有啥不好的，订阅费很便宜</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18044938\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f5dc/0915/43239_normal.png?m=1772119990\" alt=\"wclebb\" data-uid=\"43239\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/wclebb\">wclebb</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 09:28:42 +08:00\">10h 44m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>改订阅后，我之前买过的就彻底不能用了，我再也不用了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18045033\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n        